// A PLAIN ADDRESS HELD IN A CARRIER IS STILL HELD (DEF-344; closed by DEF-413, landing 176; these cases landing 177a's, measured refused on 176b and on this build): an array literal, a `List`, a nested literal, an Optional, a pointer to
